    "description": "All allies within 6 squares of you gain a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> checks made to escape <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapples\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grapples\">Grapples</a> or other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Immobilizing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immobilizing\">Immobilizing</a> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a>.<br><br>Additionally, whenever an ally within 6 squares of you is moved against its will (such as by the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Object\" title=\"Move Object\">Move Object</a></i> Force Power or the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bantha_Rush\" title=\"Bantha Rush\">Bantha Rush</a> feat), you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to negate the forced movement entirely.",
